| Requirement       | Purpose                   | Status |
| ----------------- | ------------------------- | ------ |
| Python 3.14       | Main programming language | ✅      |
| Faster-Whisper    | Voice → text              | ✅      |
| Ollama            | Local LLM runtime         | ✅      |
| Qwen3 4B Instruct | MIVA's brain              | ✅      |
| Piper TTS         | Text → voice              | ✅      |
| sounddevice       | Microphone recording      | ✅      |
| winsound          | Windows audio playback    | ✅      |


What each part does

CORE/
Main MIVA code.

main.py
Starts MIVA and connects everything together.

MIVA starts
   ↓
Listen → Think → Speak

voice.py
Handles microphone + Faster-Whisper.

brain.py
Handles Qwen/Ollama.

speech.py
Handles Piper TTS + audio playback.

pc_control/
Everything related to controlling the computer.

pc_control/
│
├── applications.py → Open/close applications
├── files.py        → File/folder operations
└── system.py       → System information/actions

voices/
Your Piper voice model.

requirements.txt
Python dependencies.

README.md
Documentation for MIVA.

.gitignore
Keeps unnecessary/private files out of GitHub.